{
  "$comment": "Core organisation of the AI company (customer-agnostic). No customer names, brands or vendor connectors here — those live in ai-company/customers/<id>/. Validated by tests/governance.test.ts. role.agent = Claude Code agent file in .claude/agents/ that executes the role today (null = planned role, executed on demand by the generic 'board-analyst' read-only agent or not at all).",
